Tabler Icons outline library
============================

ReShiki uses outline icon path data, names, categories and tags from
Tabler Icons 3.50.0, published as npm @tabler/icons 3.50.0.
https://tabler.io/icons
https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons

Tarball integrity
sha512-HflLxyrH1cqC7s7jzQGSjpsTAVIoaf7+/yHjbdM59rJQBMjliibp+LYhDPFxOMcwa1M8DNpOk6ENzQiWn9a1Dg==

scripts/build_tabler_icons.py generates assets/icons/tabler-outline.tsv from
that package. The Japanese search words in assets/icons/tabler-ja.tsv are
ReShiki's own.

